        "user_title": "",
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>1. &nbsp;Yes, as long as they didn't drop that power associated with the Green ability in a particular form&nbsp;it's available to them&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. &nbsp;For that bird form you'd have to drop a power and pick up Flight using the die of what you dropped. &nbsp;Assuming they didn't have Flight as a power already.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. &nbsp;I personally don't see an issue with it but the idea seems to be limited to powers in the archetype&nbsp;</p>",
